{
  "why": "The ability library of the Mob Foundry: 50 abilities that are rows of data over 25 pure kinds (FoundryAbilityKind). A mob row names two or three of them. Fields: id; kind; cd = cooldown ticks; min/max = the distance (blocks) to the target at which the AI may use it (max 0 = no target needed); wind = wind-up ticks (the cast clip plays, a Rukh gathers); pow = multiplier of the mob's attack damage (heal power for HEAL); dur = duration ticks; n = count (arrows, summons, pulses); r = radius blocks; amp = effect amplifier; hp = only while health is below this fraction (0 = always); align = rukh colour (road = the road's own: light on the Holy road, dark on the Abyssal one); snd = sound id. Only Light/Dark Rukh particles are ever shown (vanilla particles are purged in this mod).",
